Case study软件指南排版案例
场景：软件手册，14pt 正文，18pt 标题，只用红色文字做警告。
层级问题：仅依靠字号区分标题正文，视觉层级偏弱；警告只靠红色文字，色盲 / 色彩弱用户无法识别警告。 
改进方案： 
给警告增加明确的 “Warning” 文字标签 + 警示图标符号； 
调整标题与正文间距，强化层级； 
在目标设备屏幕上完成可读性测试，不把颜色作为唯一提示手段。
15‑min Case study：写一页英文操作指南
选题：Task A：Create a private repository with a README on GitHub
Time plan: Plan 2 min｜Draft 7 min｜Peer‑test 4 min｜Revise 2 min 
# Create a private repository with a README Goal: Create a new private GitHub repository containing a default README file. Before you start (Prerequisites)
You have signed‑in GitHub account on desktop browser. 
You have permission to create new repositories under your account. 
Procedure
Click the plus + menu in the top‑right GitHub navigation bar. 
Select New repository from the dropdown menu. 
Type docs‑practice as your repository name. If this name is taken, use another available name. 
Select the Private visibility option. 
Check the box for Add a README file. 
Click Create repository. 
Check your result
The repository main page loads and displays your README file content.
If it fails
If repository creation fails, double‑check your account permission and repository name availability.
Peer‑test feedback example： At step 1, I need to know where the plus menu locates (top‑right corner). Revision: Add description: Click the plus + menu located at top‑right corner of GitHub webpage.
④ GitHub 四选一实操任务（选任务 B：Edit your repository’s README.md）
Task B: Edit your repository’s README.md Start: You own the repository and you have edit permission. Goal: Update README to include a goal and three numbered task steps inside README. Prerequisites
Desktop web browser, signed‑in GitHub account. 
Your existing repository. 
Steps
Navigate to your repository main page. 
Find the README.md file and click the pencil edit icon. 
Add a task goal and three numbered procedural steps into the Markdown content. 
Select Preview tab to verify formatting. 
Fill commit message and select Commit changes. 
Check result: Refresh page; the updated content appears on repository homepage.
